 Vale cada centavo.","**Leave a bad taste.** — Deixar gosto ruim.","**Savour the moment.** — Saborear o momento.","**Palate cleanser.** — Limpa-paladar.","**In good spirits.** — Bem-disposto.","**Mature with age.** — Melhorar com o tempo.","**What do you smell?** — O que você sente no aroma?","**Ripe plum and cedar, with tobacco leaf.** — Ameixa madura e cedro, com folha de tabaco.","**And how does it taste?** — E como é o sabor?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"linger","pt":"persistir","forms":[["I / you / we / they linger","Flavours linger."],["he / she / it lingers","Sabores persistem."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Tasting room","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Tasting room","lines":[["Guest","What do you smell?","O que você sente no aroma?"],["Sommelier","Ripe plum and cedar, with tobacco leaf.","Ameixa madura e cedro, com folha de tabaco."],["Guest","And how does it taste?","E como é o sabor?"],["Sommelier","Full-bodied and balanced, with a long finish.","Encorpado e equilibrado, com final longo."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ritmo e ênfase para nuances","items":[{"label":"Ritmo e ênfase para nuances","note":"Ritmo e ênfase para nuances: o acento muda o sentido (He said she STOLE it × he said SHE stole it) e as pausas separam ideias técnicas densas.","words":["I didn’t SAY he did it.","I didn’t say HE did it.","I didn’t say he DID it."]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe an aroma.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"On the nose, ripe plum and cedar."},{"q":"Describe structure.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"Full-bodied, with supple tannins."},{"q":"Give a judgement.","pt":"Julgue.","model":"Approachable now, sublime in five years."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-sentence tasting note for a coffee, tea or dish, separating description from judgement.","model":"On the nose, 